<title>FINLAND: OLVI 1996 PROFIT FALLS 44 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>OLVI 1996 PROFIT FALLS 44 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   22.5 vs 40.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   7.79 vs 15.04</p>
<p> Net sales					  295.9 vs 311.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				  21.6 vs 35.4</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	47.3 vs 59.7</p>
<p> Depreciation					25.8 vs 24.3</p>
<p> Net financial items			 gain 0.9 vs 4.5 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		     charge 0.2 vs 0.9 gain</p>
<p> Taxes						  7.5 vs 12.3</p>
<p> Net profit					  19.3 vs 33.6</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    67.9 vs 71.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish brewer is Olvi Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0240</p>
